is disgraceful you should be ashamed.

514
00:30:23,800 --> 00:30:26,837
Shut up these two have
held me back far too long

515
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:30,437
just let me unleash my
full power i could take

516
00:30:30,520 --> 00:30:32,757
care of this whole island
myself if it weren't

517
00:30:32,840 --> 00:30:35,664
for these two bunglers
always getting in my way?

518
00:30:36,100 --> 00:30:38,537
Huh, that's some big talk, Shudder.

519
00:30:38,620 --> 00:30:42,417
Maybe it's time for me to teach you
what the true meaning of power is,

520
00:30:42,500 --> 00:30:44,441
if you think you've got the guts.

521
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:53,420
Let's see if you can
handle the ordeal of iron.

522
00:30:53,740 --> 00:30:57,446
Your ordeal of iron couldn't even
test the strength of a child.

523
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:02,577
My ordeal of swamp is
the ultimate challenge.

524
00:31:02,660 --> 00:31:04,660
Try that if you're not too afraid.

525
00:31:05,640 --> 00:31:08,480
My Lord Kitetsu, that
looks extremely tiring.

526
00:31:08,820 --> 00:31:10,017
If you want to cross your arms,

527
00:31:10,100 --> 00:31:12,957
you need to hold them like this
and rest them on your chest.

528
00:31:13,040 --> 00:31:13,920
Oh, hey!

529
00:31:14,660 --> 00:31:15,490
Enough!

530
00:31:15,640 --> 00:31:16,758
Cease this chatter!

531
00:31:17,140 --> 00:31:19,905
You're standing in the
presence of God himself!

532
00:31:20,720 --> 00:31:21,550
Really?

533
00:31:21,633 --> 00:31:22,920
I see an empty chair.

534
00:31:23,140 --> 00:31:25,081
I don't see anyone sitting in it.

535
00:31:26,820 --> 00:31:27,960
Surprise, boys!

536
00:31:45,780 --> 00:31:47,000
You asked?

537
00:31:47,340 --> 00:31:48,520
Here I am.

538
00:31:48,740 --> 00:31:50,397
You boys are getting slow.

539
00:31:50,480 --> 00:31:51,717
You're out of practice.

540
00:31:51,800 --> 00:31:54,397
If that pathetic display
is any indication,

541
00:31:54,480 --> 00:31:58,068
you're all well on your way
towards ending up dismal failures

542
00:31:58,340 --> 00:31:59,170
like Satorade.

543
00:31:59,540 --> 00:32:01,357
What is the meaning of this?

544
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:04,020
Why, God, why do you mock us?

545
00:32:04,120 --> 00:32:07,767
Is that the reason you summoned
us here to entertain yourself?

546
00:32:07,900 --> 00:32:09,080
I was bored.

547
00:32:11,160 --> 00:32:12,460
Now have a seat.

548
00:32:13,240 --> 00:32:16,877
You don't seem to have given too much
thought to the Blue Sea-Dwellers yet,

549
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:17,790
have you?

550
00:32:18,100 --> 00:32:21,237
God, Inaru, if this is
about Sartori's failure...

551
00:32:21,320 --> 00:32:23,440
That idiot was too inexperienced.

552
00:32:23,620 --> 00:32:26,220
And that ridiculous ordeal of spheres. Ha!

553
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:30,500
You're hardly in a
position to talk, Shura.

554
00:32:32,980 --> 00:32:34,957
Why they're looking for gold?

555
00:32:35,040 --> 00:32:36,777
That's obvious.

556
00:32:36,860 --> 00:32:38,480
What? Gold?

557
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:40,857
Impossible How...

558
00:32:40,940 --> 00:32:42,080
how did they know?

559
00:32:42,700 --> 00:32:45,497
This island was originally
part of the Blue Sea.

560
00:32:45,580 --> 00:32:48,800
It's not so odd that they
should know about it.

561
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:54,537
Of course, they'll move tomorrow!

562
00:32:54,620 --> 00:32:56,840
As will the Shandians.

563
00:32:58,080 --> 00:33:01,357
The rules state that each of you
run an area of the upper yard.

564
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:03,457
And you're not allowed
to enter each other's

565
00:33:03,540 --> 00:33:06,305
areas or interfere with
one another in any way.

566
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:09,706
Tomorrow, I'll allow you
to go where you will.

567
00:33:10,180 --> 00:33:13,340
You may set up your
ordeals wherever you want.

568
00:33:14,060 --> 00:33:15,677
There will be no restrictions.

569
00:33:15,760 --> 00:33:18,060
Get as vicious as you like.

570
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:21,426
Why are you being so
generous all of a sudden?

571
00:33:21,600 --> 00:33:26,597
Because my friends i'm pleased to announce
that the maxim is almost complete.

572
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:29,797
So it's time for us to put an
end to this wretched island!

573
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:33,140
and set forth on our journey
to the world of dreams.

574
00:33:36,300 --> 00:33:37,220
It's true!

575
00:33:37,440 --> 00:33:38,477
I wasn't dreaming!

576
00:33:38,560 --> 00:33:40,300
Someone was here last night!

577
00:33:41,020 --> 00:33:42,160
The Going Mary!

578
00:33:42,620 --> 00:33:43,940
She's been repaired!

579
00:33:45,780 --> 00:33:46,980
I knew it!

580
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:50,520
See, guys, I told you I wasn't insane!

581
00:33:53,260 --> 00:33:54,800
I don't believe it.

582
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:56,480
The mast is fixed.

583
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:58,660
Hey, now that's service.

584
00:33:59,080 --> 00:34:02,220
I hate to say it, but
they did a lousy job.

585
00:34:02,460 --> 00:34:04,460
Well, whoever did it sure is nice.

586
00:34:04,720 --> 00:34:07,257
But who'd risk crossing a
river full of sky sharks

587
00:34:07,340 --> 00:34:09,957
to come all the way out here
and fix our ship for us?

588
00:34:10,040 --> 00:34:11,920
I mean, as far as we can tell,

589
00:34:12,120 --> 00:34:15,532
the only people here on Upper
Yard are us and our enemies.

590
00:34:15,660 --> 00:34:19,297
Hey, did you notice they took
all the flying gear off the ship?

591
00:34:19,380 --> 00:34:20,210
That's weird.

592
00:34:22,480 --> 00:34:26,127
I've been thinking about it, and
it's really got me wondering.

593
00:34:29,360 --> 00:34:30,190
Huh.

594
00:34:30,300 --> 00:34:32,377
It just doesn't make any sense to me.

595
00:34:32,460 --> 00:34:36,477
How could this phantom repairman know
what the Mary's supposed to look like?

596
00:34:36,560 --> 00:34:40,384
How did he know she didn't always
have a comb or wings or a tail?

597
00:34:42,660 --> 00:34:43,490
Hmm.

598
00:34:43,573 --> 00:34:45,280
How could he possibly have known?

599
00:34:51,380 --> 00:34:52,497
Come on, Mary.

600
00:34:52,580 --> 00:34:54,460
Just tell me who I saw.

601
00:35:00,100 --> 00:35:01,860
Okay, let's look at the map.

602
00:35:02,140 --> 00:35:05,800
The exploration team will be
taking this route, moving south.

603
00:35:06,380 --> 00:35:09,497
There should be some old ruins
near the Skull's right eye.

604
00:35:09,580 --> 00:35:12,597
Keep an eye out for enemies
and bring back that gold.

605
00:35:12,680 --> 00:35:14,720
Huh, you make it sound so easy.

606
00:35:14,900 --> 00:35:17,837
Hold on, you're the one who keeps
talking about gold and more gold,

607
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:18,757
but you're not coming?

608
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:21,157
Well, of course not, it's way too scary.

609
00:35:21,240 --> 00:35:24,617
She wants the gold, but she doesn't
want to risk anything to get it?

610
00:35:24,700 --> 00:35:25,994
That's just too weird!

611
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:29,497
We'll be in danger too
you know we'll be taking

612
00:35:29,580 --> 00:35:33,517
the mary down river through
the island then we'll

613
00:35:33,600 --> 00:35:36,337
head for the beach near
the ruins we can meet up

614
00:35:36,420 --> 00:35:39,820
here and then we can escape
this stupid sky island?

615
00:35:40,520 --> 00:35:44,397
At long last we'll be a rich and
powerful pirate crew able to buy

616
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:50,697
anything oh yeah all the meat i
can eat escape that sounds great

617
00:35:50,780 --> 00:35:57,077
look the weather's perfect sure
we're on top of the clouds okay

618
00:35:57,160 --> 00:36:01,640
we'll all meet safely on the east
coast you bet let's get going then!

619
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:36,440
Who will fall before my ordeal of string?

620
00:36:36,780 --> 00:36:40,320
The Shandians or the Blue Sea-dwellers?

621
00:36:46,220 --> 00:36:49,780
And so the festival begins, magnificent.

622
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:52,540
Today will be a great day.
